Harlow: (cough) Federal Monkey Patrol. Harlow here.

Chief: Harlow - this is the Chief of Police! We have a situation here, get your keister to the station. Your city needs you!

Harlow: ...I think you have the wrong guy, Chief. See, I deal with monkeys, just monkeys. I've looked into it and this town doesn't even have any monkeys. There's not a monkey for miles!

Harlow: If it wasn't for the chance to beat up a few drunks in gorilla suits each Halloween on the city's dime, I wouldn't even bother showing up. Call someplace else.
